  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*Question 1: Figure of Merit*)\r\n\r\n(*Define the Analytical Solution*)\r\nClearAll[\"Global`*\"]\r\nClearAll[analytical]\r\n\r\n\\[Phi]0 = 30 Degree\r\n\r\nanalytical[t_] := \\[Phi]0*Cos[\\[Omega]0*t]\r\nPlot[analytical[t], {t, 0, 2}, PlotLabel -> \"Analytical Solution at 30 Degrees\"]\r\n\r\nanalytical[0.25]\r\n\r\n(*Getting The FOM*)\r\nFOM = Sqrt[NIntegrate[(sol[[1]][[1]][[2]][t] - analytical[t])^2, {t, 0, 2}]]\r\n\r\n(*For given angle 30 degrees, the simulation and analytical solution produce very similar plots.*)\r\n(*For our Figure of Merit (FOM), the closer the value is to zero, the more accruate our simulated solution is to the analytical one.*)",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wexpr\"><wgraph class=\"resizable\" style=\"width:41px;height:25px;\" aspect-ratio=\"0.6078\" tabIndex=\"-1\"><img class=\"invert-brightness\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" /></wgraph></div>",
