  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*Question 2: Increasing the Initial Angle*)\r\nClearAll[\"Global`*\"]\r\nClearAll[analytical]\r\nClearAll[\\[Phi]0]\r\n\r\n\\[Phi]0 = 100 Degree\r\n\r\nanalytical[t_] := \\[Phi]0*Cos[\\[Omega]0*t]\r\nPlot[analytical[t], {t, 0, 2}, PlotLabel -> \"Analytical Solution at 100 Degrees\"]\r\n\r\nanalytical[0.25]\r\n\r\n(*Getting The FOM*)\r\nFOM = Sqrt[NIntegrate[(sol[[1]][[1]][[2]][t] - analytical[t])^2, {t, 0, 2}]]\r\n\r\n(*As I increase the initial angle, my simulation results relative to my analytical results experience decreased accuracy (when observing the FOM).*)",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
