  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*Question 3: Plotting the FOM*)\r\n(*Evaluate the FOM at 5 different initial angles and plot them*)\r\n\r\nClearAll[\"Global`*\"]\r\nClearAll[analytical]\r\nClearAll[\\[Phi]0]\r\nClearAll[FOM]\r\n\r\ninitialAngles = {}\r\nFOMs = {}\r\n\r\nanalytical[t_] := \\[Phi]0*Cos[\\[Omega]0*t]\r\n\r\nFor[i = 0, i <= 90, i += 5, \r\n    \\[Phi]0 = i Degree;\r\n    AppendTo[initialAngles, \\[Phi]0];\r\n    FOM = Sqrt[NIntegrate[(sol[[1]][[1]][[2]][t] - analytical[t])^2, {t, 0, 2}]];\r\n    AppendTo[FOMs, FOM];\r\n]\r\n\r\nListPlot[Transpose[{initialAngles, FOMs}],\r\n    PlotRange -> {{0 Degree, 90 Degree}, Automatic},\r\n    PlotLabel -> \"FOM vs Initial Angles\",\r\n    AxesLabel -> {\"\\[Phi]0\", \"FOM\"}    \r\n]\r\n\r\n(*I have come to the conclusion that the small angle approximation starts to significantly deviate (by about 10%) after 40 degrees*)\r\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
